From: iceland <iceland@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Add a hall sensor (data type "hall") and ssccli --sensor hall

The OnePlus Pad 4's sensor hub has a hall sensor (ROHM BU52053NVX, data type "hall") for the
cover. Its event layout is not documented: the first field of a sensor event is decoded
generically and reported with the message id; messages are logged at debug level.
---
